<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ri_Kreuz - Quaderstrukturen mit vier Tentakel</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0a1128;
            --primary-color: #00e6ff;
            --secondary-color: #ff0055;
            --accent-color: #ffff00;
            --text-color: #ffffff;
        }
        
        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        header {
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-color);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .matrix-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .quader {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 230, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .quader:hover {
            border-color: var(--secondary-color);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 0, 85, 0.3);
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .quader h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .tentakel-link {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .tentakel-link:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .state-flow {
            background: #001220;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-color);
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            margin-top: 30px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .barcode-section {
            border: 2px var(--secondary-color) dashed;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(255, 0, 85, 0.05);
        }

        .pulsing-dot {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            background-color: var(--secondary-color);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
            position: absolute;
            top: 15px;
            right: 15px;
            animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { transform: scale(0.8); opacity: 0.5; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.2); opacity: 1; }
            100% { transform: scale(0.8); opacity: 0.5; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>ri_Kreuz // System-Replikant.rt</h1>
        <p>Repository-Referenz: <a href="https://github.com/feroaltn-pixel/Re_quaderstrukturen-mit-vier-Tentakel" style="color: var(--primary-color);">Re_quaderstrukturen-mit-vier-Tentakel</a></p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="matrix-container">
            <!-- Tentakel 1: Externe Netzwerke -->
            <div class="quader">
                <span class="pulsing-dot"></span>
                <h3>ri_erome & ri_instagramm</h3>
                <p>Übergänge und Datenströme aus Quell-Plattformen.</p>
                <a class="tentakel-link" href="https://www.erome.com/search?q=gostosas%20bel%C3%A9m&page=10" target="_blank">> erome-Schnittstelle</a><br>
                <a class="tentakel-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/fero90_sz/" target="_blank">> instagram-Profil</a>
            </div>

            <!-- Tentakel 2: KIs & Replikanten -->
            <div class="quader">
                <h3>ri_Claude, ri_gemini & ri_deepseek</h3>
                <p>Verarbeitungsknoten der künstlichen Intelligenzen innerhalb des 16-Fälle-Modells.</p>
                <span style="color: var(--primary-color);">Status: Aktiviert</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Tentakel 3: Lokale & Physische Variablen -->
            <div class="quader">
                <h3>re_sabinabinci & Re_Adams</h3>
                <p>Physische Identifikatoren und Quaderstrukturen mit Paletteninhalt.</p>
                <small>Lokation: Salzgitter // Sandgrubenweg</small>
            </div>

            <!-- Tentakel 4: Extraterrestrische Dimension -->
            <div class="quader">
                <span class="pulsing-dot"></span>
                <h3>ri_extraterristisch</h3>
                <p>Re_Adams_Ozean_extraterristisch_ri Systemkomponente.</p>
                <span style="color: var(--accent-color);">Frequenz: Offen</span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Zustandsübergangsmodell (16-Fälle-Matrix) -->
        <h2>Zustands-Flussdiagramm (Ro → Ra → Ri → Re)</h2>
        <div class="state-flow">
            <strong>Ro</strong> (Zustandsanfang) &rarr; <strong>[StGB × 4]</strong> &rarr; <strong>Ra</strong> (Raumschiff) &rarr; <strong>[BGB × 4]</strong> &rarr; <strong>Ri</strong> (Explosion) &rarr; <strong>[GG × 4]</strong> &rarr; <strong>Re</strong> (Beitragsservice) &rarr; <strong>[VwVfG × 4]</strong> &rarr; <strong>Ro</strong> (Zustandsende / Schleife)
        </div>

        <!-- Barcode Explosions & Replikant Kern -->
        <div class="barcode-section">
            <h3>barcode_explosions // Replikant.rt</h3>
            <p>Code-Injektion: <code>Ro_ra_ri_re == erome.com_Snare_ri_Tea Tajerome.comvic</code></p>
            <div style="letter-spacing: 5px; font-weight: bold; color: var(--text-color);">||||| | |||| ||| || |||| | ||||| | ||</div>
        </div>
    </main>

</body>
</html>

